flowchart LR
  Developer --> GitHubPR[GitHub pull request]
  GitHubPR --> Actions[GitHub Actions checks]
  Actions --> GHCR[GHCR image tagged with commit SHA]
  GHCR --> Staging[Staging]
  Staging --> Approval{Production approval}
  Approval --> Production[Production]

  subgraph ComposeHost[Docker Compose host]
    Nginx[Nginx] --> App[FastAPI app]
    App -->|/metrics| Prometheus[Prometheus]
    CAdvisor[cAdvisor] --> Prometheus
    NodeExporter[Node Exporter] --> Prometheus
    Prometheus --> Alertmanager[Alertmanager]
    Alertmanager -->|webhook| Healer[Healer]
    Prometheus --> Grafana[Grafana]
    Healer --> DockerProxy[Docker socket proxy]
    DockerProxy -->|allowlisted recovery| App
  end

  Healer -->|optional, redacted logs| Anthropic[Anthropic API]
  Healer -->|optional notification| Telegram[Telegram]
